<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Marlin shareholders approve Kudu merger.</title>
<headline>Marlin shareholders approve Kudu merger.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African granite firm Marlin Corp said on Friday that shareholders had voted to approve its buy of an effective 56.2 percent stake in rival Kudu Granite Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The vote also approved the buy of Germany's Deutsche Steinindustrie Aktiengesellschaft claims against Destag SA and Kudu, the buy of Stone Enterprises Ltd and 33.3 percent of the shares of Natural Stone Processors.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
